ionary Society (LMS).","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":7,"text":" He was impressed by the school and the quality of the education given there and was convinced that the new type of school held out great prospects for the people of the state.","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":8,"text":" The school later evolved into Scott Christian College, Nagercoil.","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":9,"text":" Shortly thereafter he invited Mr. Roberts who was in-charge of the school at Nagarcoil to come to Thiruvananthapuram and start a similar school there.","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":10,"text":" The educationist, who was an Englishman, agreed and a new school was started in 1834."","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":11,"text":" The school started by Mr. Roberts has now blossomed into the University College, Thiruvananthapuram.","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":12,"text":" So Scott Christian College is also linked to University college, and both are now reputed colleges.","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":13,"text":" The alumni of the college are called Scottians.","title":"Scott Christian College"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Caliber International College is an institution of higher education at Rajbiraj, Nepal.","title":"Caliber International College"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The college is established in 2006.","title":"Caliber International College"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" The founder of the college is Arun Yadav.","title":"Caliber International College"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" The college belongs to the first group of colleges in Rajbiraj to receive academic accreditation from the Purbanchal University.","title":"Caliber International College"},{"sentence_id":4,"text":" The college offer 10+2 and Bachelor level courses.","title":"Caliber International College"},{"sentence_id":5,"text":" This is the first college in Rajbiraj which offer Bachelor in Bu